<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.4406 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.4406 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4406 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.4700 on Wedneday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 19		 June 18</p>
<p> High			     75.5000		 75.4700</p>
<p> Low				75.4200		 75.3500</p>
<p> Open			     75.5000		 75.3500</p>
<p> Close			    75.4406		 75.4700</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  2.975		   2.135</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
